1
00:00:00,264 --> 00:00:03,294
(Amy:)It was a lot hotter
than it sounds.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,600
(Alfred:)You're a patient
young lady.

3
00:00:04,602 --> 00:00:05,632
Hey, hey!

4
00:00:05,636 --> 00:00:07,806
She's mine! Take a cold shower,
grandpa!

5
00:00:11,942 --> 00:00:14,192
(Howard:)Why wouldn't that colonel say
what the meeting's about?

6
00:00:14,194 --> 00:00:15,724
(Howard:)It has to be bad news.

7
00:00:15,729 --> 00:00:17,979
(Raj:)Calm down, okay?
Try not to think about it.

8
00:00:17,982 --> 00:00:20,532
(Howard:)That's really stupid advice.

9
00:00:20,534 --> 00:00:22,364
(Raj:)You know that hurts
my feelings.

10
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:25,533
(Howard:)Calm down, try not
to think about it.

11
00:00:26,573 --> 00:00:28,123
(Sheldon:)Okay.

12
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,330
(Howard:)Why do I bother
talking to you?

13
00:00:31,328 --> 00:00:33,998
(Raj:)Oh, come on. What's the worst
that could come of this meeting?

14
00:00:33,998 --> 00:00:36,128
(Howard:)I don't know. They take
the invention away,

15
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,303
(Howard:)and I get nothing?

16
00:00:37,301 --> 00:00:39,331
(Raj:)Okay, that's not so bad.

17
00:00:39,336 --> 00:00:40,586
(Raj:)You know what happened
to the scientists

18
00:00:40,587 --> 00:00:42,167
(Raj:)that worked
on the Manhattan Project?

19
00:00:42,172 --> 00:00:44,342
(Raj:)The government forced them
to move to the desert.

20
00:00:44,341 --> 00:00:47,511
(Raj:)They had to live in secret,
and when Oppenheimer objected

21
00:00:47,511 --> 00:00:48,681
(Raj:)to what they made him do,

22
00:00:48,679 --> 00:00:50,679
(Raj:)they destroyed his reputation.

23
00:00:51,765 --> 00:00:54,905
(Howard:)What's the point of that story?

24
00:00:56,186 --> 00:00:57,686
(Raj:)I just read a book
about Oppenheimer,

